# Certificates other than the Radware certificate authority, which must ship:
# customers upload certs/rdwr-root-ca.pem and certs/rdwr-intermediate-ca.pem
# in Step 1 Path A (public CA certificates, not secrets).
*.pem
*.cer
!certs/rdwr-ca-chain.pem
!certs/rdwr-root-ca.pem
!certs/rdwr-intermediate-ca.pem

